# ==============================================================================
# .gitignore for Manuscript Data & Code Repository
# Tracks all source code, Jupyter notebooks, post-hoc verification logs,
# primary real-time LAN capture & flow datasets (PCAP, CICFlowMeter CSVs,
# Approach 1 CSV, Suricata EVE/fast logs, Phase/R3/Unified alerts, runtime logs),
# and Track B prompt chunks (<100 MB per-file GitHub hard limit; ~327 MB total).
#
# Excludes third-party public benchmark datasets (multi-GB), >100 MB derived
# intermediates, large binary .pkl checkpoints, ZIP archives, duplicate
# realtime working copies (/realtime_file/data/), and manuscript drafts.
# ==============================================================================

# --- Python, Jupyter & Environment ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.Python
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env
.env.*
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- OS, Editor & Office Lock/Temp Files ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
~$*
*.tmp
*.bak
*.flag

# --- Archives & Large Bundle Downloads ---
*.zip

# --- Large Trained Model Checkpoints, Pickles & Feature Caches (67 MB - 661 MB) ---
# Note: lightweight summary pickles under colab_file/results/*/*.pkl remain tracked.
/model/
/realtime_file/model/
/realtime_file/*.pkl
/colab_file/models/
/colab_file/cache/

# --- Raw Public Benchmark Datasets & >100 MB Track B Split Intermediates ---
# (Publicly downloadable from UNB CICIDS2017, UNSW-NB15, and Kaggle NSL-KDD)
/colab_file/data/
/colab_file/nids_role3/data/cic_labels/
/colab_file/nids_role3/data/cicflow_csv_labelled/
/colab_file/nids_role3/data/eve_logs/
/colab_file/nids_role3/data/flow_friday/
/colab_file/nids_role3/data/flow_thursday/
/colab_file/nids_role3/data/flow_tuesday/
/colab_file/nids_role3/data/flow_wednesday/

# --- Real-Time Testbed Oversized / Duplicate Paths ---
# All primary live data lives under /realtime_file/realtime_data/ (tracked below):
#   - pcaps/capture_full.pcap (24.74 MB) & 341 pcaps/segments/*.pcap (<=11.68 MB)
#   - csv/approach_a_flows.csv (61.71 MB), 63 csv/cicflow_csv/*.csv (<=23.80 MB)
#   - json/suricata/eve.json (71.50 MB), fast.log, stats.log, suricata.log
#   - json/phases.jsonl, json/r3.jsonl, json/unified_alerts.jsonl, json/role1_proba_debug.jsonl
#   - logs/, chunks/, reports/
# Exclude duplicate raw working directory and flows.jsonl (254.43 MB > 100 MB GitHub limit;
# identical 92,237 flow records and 52 features are already tracked in csv/approach_a_flows.csv):
/realtime_file/data/
/realtime_file/nids_history.json
/realtime_file/realtime_data/json/flows.jsonl
ollama_dns_cache.json
**/* copy.py

# --- Manuscript Drafts, Peer-Review Files & Writing Skills ---
/review_file/
/skill/

# Root legacy logs directory
/logs/
